ng an eye. <br>Fortunately, Doodlers can use their gastric problems against him. <br>Just find a match, light your fart and feel the boost.<br>And if this won't help, just release stinky gases in his face to stun him. This is your last resort.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/670930/extras/8aab6c776168079a81d83fc840d94eaa.avif?t=1792505658\" width=682 height=142 /></span>",
